{"papers":[{"id":"official:9f5b951e25ad0f0e","title":"Better exploration with parameter noise","url":"https://openai.com/index/better-exploration-with-parameter-noise","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://openai.com/index/better-exploration-with-parameter-noise"],"alternate_titles":["Better exploration with parameter noise"],"published":"2017-07-27","authors":["OpenAI"],"abstract":"We’ve found that adding adaptive noise to the parameters of reinforcement learning algorithms frequently boosts performance. This exploration method is simple to implement and very rarely decreases performance, so it’s worth trying on any problem.","companies":["OpenAI"],"matched_orgs":["OpenAI"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"research_post","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":56,"matched_keywords":["Research"],"author_affiliations":["OpenAI"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official RSS feed https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://openai.com/index/better-exploration-with-parameter-noise","labs":["OpenAI"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official RSS feed https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://openai.com/news/rss.xml","matched_terms":["reinforcement learning"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"research_post"},"ai_research_source":"https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"},{"id":"official:e7531ea4ca0d5711","title":"Proximal Policy Optimization","url":"https://openai.com/index/openai-baselines-ppo","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://openai.com/index/openai-baselines-ppo"],"alternate_titles":["Proximal Policy Optimization"],"published":"2017-07-20","authors":["OpenAI"],"abstract":"We’re releasing a new class of reinforcement learning algorithms, Proximal Policy Optimization (PPO), which perform comparably or better than state-of-the-art approaches while being much simpler to implement and tune. PPO has become the default reinforcement learning algorithm at OpenAI because of its ease of use and good performance.","companies":["OpenAI"],"matched_orgs":["OpenAI"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"research_post","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":56,"matched_keywords":["Research"],"author_affiliations":["OpenAI"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official RSS feed https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://openai.com/index/openai-baselines-ppo","labs":["OpenAI"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official RSS feed https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://openai.com/news/rss.xml","matched_terms":["reinforcement learning"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"research_post"},"ai_research_source":"https://openai.com/news/rss.xml"},{"id":"apple:lvazwljqd8drsy95p67o0rd6","title":"Learning from Simulated and Unsupervised Images through Adversarial Training","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/learning-from-simulated-and-unsupervised-images-through-adversarial-training","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/learning-from-simulated-and-unsupervised-images-through-adversarial-training"],"alternate_titles":["Learning from Simulated and Unsupervised Images through Adversarial Training"],"published":"2017-07-19","authors":["Ashish Shrivastava","Tomas Pfister","Oncel Tuzel","Josh Susskind","Wenda Wang","Russ Webb"],"abstract":"With recent progress in graphics, it has become more tractable to train models on synthetic images, potentially avoiding the need for expensive annotations. However, learning from synthetic images may not achieve the desired performance due to a gap between synthetic and real image distributions. To reduce this gap, we propose Simulated+Unsupervised (S+U) learning, where the task is to learn a model to improve the realism of a simulator's output...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/learning-from-simulated-and-unsupervised-images-through-adversarial-training","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":[],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"official:75f100087d7cfbf5","title":"Robust adversarial inputs","url":"https://openai.com/index/robust-adversarial-inputs","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://openai.com/index/robust-adversarial-inputs"],"alternate_titles":["Robust adversarial inputs"],"published":"2017-07-17","authors":["OpenAI"],"abstract":"We’ve created images that reliably fool neural network classifiers when viewed from varied scales and perspectives. This challenges a claim from last week that self-driving cars would be hard to trick malic